/* _UIB-CODE-BLOCK-END */
&ANALYZE-RESUME


&Scoped-define FRAME-NAME fPage5
&Scoped-define SELF-NAME btDelete
&ANALYZE-SUSPEND _UIB-CODE-BLOCK _CONTROL btDelete wReport
ON CHOOSE OF btDelete IN FRAME fPage5 /* Retirar */
